This isnt a big feature, it is an abstraction, a dream. A small thing to turn data into value, a Trail one can follow, with steps ranging from online personal education to how to build a school, how to organize the learning of the teachers and how do they rotate the student's learning across several subjects for maximum development. A good Lince will allow for this Trail to be edited, agreed upon, by many people, before it is is unwrapped and it's tasks assigned, and the work done by each envolved.

